Third-party dictionary data notice:

This project bundles a derived Japanese surname/given-name lexicon in
`src/data/japaneseNameLexicon.json`, generated from ENAMDICT/JMnedict data by
the Electronic Dictionary Research and Development Group (EDRDG):
<https://www.edrdg.org/>

Per EDRDG's dictionary license statement, dictionary files and derived data
files are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International (CC BY-SA 4.0):
